/target
# Cargo.lock IS tracked (application crate, not library) — without it
# Cloud Build's tarball doesn't include it and wasm-pack regenerates
# with whatever's latest on crates.io. That bit us 2026-06-08 when
# wasm-bindgen-cli 0.2.123 demanded a newer rustc than our base image.
# Keep this commit-tracked for reproducible builds.
/pkg/
web/pkg/
web/node_modules/
web/.next/

.claude-flow/.trend-cache.json

.env.local

# GCP service account keys — never commit
key.json
*-key.json
gcp-*.json
# Runtime + build artifacts that were tracked by accident. Ignoring a
# tracked file has no effect, so these were also untracked with
# `git rm --cached` — the working copies are left in place.
web/data/server.log
web/data/server.log.1
*.tsbuildinfo

# Claude Code per-machine settings (local permission grants) — not shared.
.claude/settings.local.json
